      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man mannan an oþres flette manswara hateþ oððe hine mid bismærwordum scandlice grete, scilling agelde þam þe þæt flet age, ⁊ VI sciƚƚ þam þe he þæt word togecwæde, ⁊ cyninge XII scƚƚ forgelde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person in another’s house calls a person a perjurer or accosts him shamefully with mocking words, let him pay a shilling to him who owns that house, and 6 shillings to him to whom he spoke that utterance, and let him pay 12 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man mannan an oþres flette manswara hateþ oððe hine mid bismærwordum scandlice grete, scilling agelde þam þe þæt flet age, ⁊ VI scill' þam þe he þæt word togecwæde, ⁊ cyninge XII scll' forgelde.</ab>
      </div>
